spawnpoint server.js fails to boot with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND for sharp (imported by src/static/GLBKtx2.js:7 for KTX2 texture conversion). sharp IS declared in package.json dependencies and present in package-lock.json, but is a native module that may not be physically installed in node_modules on a fresh/synced checkout. Fix: npm install sharp. Do NOT commit the resulting package.json/package-lock.json changes — npm install only reorders optionalDependencies and strips a license metadata line; the manifests were already correct, so git checkout -- package.json package-lock.json after installing. Needed before any browser-witness that loads the live app.